  "goodToKnow": "Die Attraktivität is attractiveness or appeal, often of places, jobs or offers: die Attraktivität des Standorts Deutschland (Germany's appeal as a business location), die Attraktivität des Lehrerberufs. Attraktiv means attractive, and die Attraktion is an attraction. Debates about Germany's Standortattraktivität focus on energy prices, bureaucracy and digitalisation. It has no plural."
